---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "../assets/photos/IMG_7883.JPG";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 lg:px-6 lg:py-28">
  <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-h2 font-bold text-green-900">We love to be outside.</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 font-sans text-body text-green-800">
        <p>
          For us it's in the details: the stripes in a fresh-cut lawn, the clean edge where the
          grass meets the walk, the contrast of new mulch, the permanence of a paver path that'll
          still look right in twenty years.
        </p>
        <p>
          That love is where our professionalism comes from. A good yard is where you host friends,
          where the kids actually go outside. Every person on our crew takes pride in the work
          because they know it makes that kind of difference.
        </p>
        <p>
          And it carries into how we treat you. We got into the service business to serve, which is
          why we hold the line on fair prices and clear communication, start to finish.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
      <Image
        src={photo}
        alt="A freshly cut, healthy lawn with crisp edges and mature plantings"
        widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw"
        class="aspect-[4/3] w-full rounded-lg object-cover"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
